   if(['切换项目','工作区长名称','恢复草稿','恢复草稿长路径','移动到文件夹','移动到深层目录'].includes(name))await page.screenshot({path:`output/playwright/assist-batch-2026-10-26/${device}-${theme}-picker-${scenes.indexOf(name)}.png`,fullPage:true});
   if(['补全候选','大字体补全','函数参数提示','多形式参数参考','内置代码片段','片段占位符导航'].includes(name))await page.screenshot({path:`output/playwright/assist-batch-2026-10-26/${device}-${theme}-assist-${scenes.indexOf(name)}.png`,fullPage:true});
